    "make_it":  [
                    "Weigh your empty mixing pot and write the number down for portioning later.",
                    "Cook the rice: rinse, simmer covered with water until tender, and set aside.",
                    "Cube the chicken breast and toss it with the harissa paste, a third of the lime juice, salt, black pepper, garlic powder, cumin, and onion powder.",
                    "Sear the chicken in a hot skillet in batches, 6 to 8 minutes per batch, until it reaches 165F inside. Crowding the pan steams it, so give it room.",
